<translate>
==== OtherHandUse ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. If the parameter is true, then the item in the extra hand will be used. (Example - Molotov cocktail and lighter)
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
OtherHandUse = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

